Convert one container block into another by moving (and cascade-converting) its child cells. `convertBlockType` now recognises a `fieldMappings` entry whose target field names a container region (`blocks_layout` or `object_list`, top-level or nested via a `data/items` path) and reshapes the region: each child is converted to a type the target region allows, transitively through the same converter. This makes e.g. tabs⇄steps⇄definitionList⇄accordion convertible, cells and content preserved.
